    "body": "I did not guess a second camera curve. The installed build adds a bounded vanilla capture for the missing evidence. Standing in third person without aiming, press Numpad9, wait for the ready line, then draw or holster once. It records lateral, distance, vertical, rotation, and gameplay/rendered FOV through the real vanilla move. This is measurement for the synchronization repair, not a claim that the two-stage movement is fixed.",
